"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130675482581274624534168.jpeg/LQhtod3KzQRxcKUbcde9HgVSOcKjkLUhQse3UnjHt1I\" alt=\"華豐閣多個單位仍然停電。（陳永武攝）\"><figcaption>華豐閣多個單位仍然停電。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130673427779162112094157.jpeg/QgyBwXdou7l-75GwG22UeJ5-synOwrB7CsZQWTDGUFk\" alt=\"華豐閣多個單位仍然停電。（陳永武攝）\"><figcaption>華豐閣多個單位仍然停電。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130673431579332608026179.jpeg/L45KDfZIrHQNhpvY7N9O7Bq07DXJQYtn6YRKBNOESgQ\" alt=\"約有40人下樓了解事件。（陳永武攝）\"><figcaption>約有40人下樓了解事件。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130673435513720832423069.jpeg/uwC_PL6QuiNrfLWssaPfsVYgKVe2VBB8bD5qX1Y-al8\" alt=\"約有40人下樓了解事件。（陳永武攝）\"><figcaption>約有40人下樓了解事件。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130673439322279936786392.jpeg/ZEQWui9ro3ycdW6DVPvKCKx22JU-p8IMbFhYbVZYWG0\" alt=\"工程人員正處理事件。（陳永武攝）\"><figcaption>工程人員正處理事件。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130673396246384640209651.jpeg/6yNYRD2g76qhYjxSBpRx-X5Wv5soc-EYPGI9-QZiPfk\" alt=\"消防和工程人員正處理事件。（陳永武攝）\"><figcaption>消防和工程人員正處理事件。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130677793231736832653790.jpeg/EOoQpwgU-KQiCpvmbL6PStOpniCRIkmK-OegfcLnoH0\" alt=\"華豐閣地下大堂同樣停電。（陳永武攝）\"><figcaption>華豐閣地下大堂同樣停電。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130677798017568768204965.jpeg/X9oMWcoKhObvSYXjWLG-PyOG7Wdfm5oigXrhg7t64YM\" alt=\"中電的流動發電車到場。（陳永武攝）\"><figcaption>中電的流動發電車到場。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><p>區議員徐曉杰亦在facebook表示，青華苑華豐閣機房岀現故障情況，暫時未能回復正常供電，青華苑其餘大廈和長康邨恢復正常供電。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130669817137729536621549.jpeg/v99H_E6wHrTTsLAh1Zy3iHc6zVDJTD9PH1TTGh9U0xo\" alt=\"警員、消防和中電人員到場處理。（區議員徐曉杰facebook圖片）\"><figcaption>警員、消防和中電人員到場處理。（區議員徐曉杰facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130669862713036800263879.jpeg/WfFMBhRGQyc753oTKz-q4CGDCHDTTyPgDE_iFwxP4hc\" alt=\"警員、消防和中電人員到場處理。（區議員徐曉杰facebook圖片）\"><figcaption>警員、消防和中電人員到場處理。（區議員徐曉杰facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260512/1130669865481408512561708.jpeg/_V1jGrP7np_05dk_Fmqb5FpAEBTmieK_yVdoq8lXaKs\" alt=\"警員、消防和中電人員到場處理。（區議員徐曉杰facebook圖片）\"><figcaption>警員、消防和中電人員到場處理。（區議員徐曉杰facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-11T17:59:11.052965+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1593,"images":21,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}